      "description": "带辅助说明的章节入口。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-tool\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 10 5-10 5L2 8l10-5Zm-10 9 10 5 10-5M2 16l10 5 10-5\"/></svg><span>历史专题<small>专题核验中</small></span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10M7 17 17 7\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-tool{font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;cursor:pointer;transition:color .2s,background-color .2s,border-color .2s,transform .3s var(--ease-out);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;text-align:left;padding:15px 20px;min-width:216px;background:#101720e6;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:var(--radius)}.ds-tool small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-tool:hover{color:var(--gold-bright)}.ds-tool:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold-bright);outline-offset:5px}.ds-tool:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-tool>svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-tool>svg:first-child{color:var(--gold)}.ds-tool>svg:last-child{margin-left:auto}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-tool{transition:none!important}}@media(prefers-reduced-transparency:reduce){.ds-tool{background:var(--surface)}}"
